### Defining dynamic prerendered routes with getStaticPaths()

Source: https://github.com/withastro/docs/blob/main/src/content/docs/en/reference/routing-reference.mdx

Returns an array of path objects specifying route params for Astro to prerender at build time. The params keys must match the parameter tokens in the component filename.

```astro
---
// In 'server' mode, opt in to prerendering:
// export const prerender = true

export async function getStaticPaths() {
  return [
    // { params: { /* required */ }, props: { /* optional */ } },
    { params: { post: '1' } }, // [post] is the parameter
    { params: { post: '2' } }, // must match the file name
    // ...
  ];
}
---
<!-- Your HTML template here. -->
```

